WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.560
But this is how we will ensure that the system works for everyone

00:03.560 --> 00:06.860
and is sustainable into the future.

00:06.860 --> 00:10.300
We're also using tariffs to defend our sovereignty and security

00:10.300 --> 00:12.560
throughout the world, including against nations

00:12.560 --> 00:16.340
that have taken advantage of former U.S. administrations

00:16.340 --> 00:17.600
for decades, including.

